They merged not because they had the same age, but because objects with
different ages can still be merged.  The age of the resulting stack is
the mean of the ages of the individual components.

In merged(), invent.c:

----------------------------------------
    if (!obj->lamplit)
        otmp->age = ((otmp->age*otmp->quan) + (obj->age*obj->quan))
          / (otmp->quan + obj->quan);

    otmp->quan += obj->quan;
